WEBVTT

00:00:02.877 --> 00:00:04.212
This can't all be true.

00:00:09.134 --> 00:00:10.176
Every word.

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:17.434
CIA black vault break in.

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:19.477
Am I reading this correctly?

00:00:20.228 --> 00:00:21.312
The Kremlin bombing.

00:00:21.312 --> 00:00:24.315
In fairness, the bomb was actually meant to kill him.

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:28.862
He gassed a security briefing.

00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:35.035
That was just two months ago.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:40.665
This explains the handcuffs. It's still not clear why he's here.

00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:45.670
If we want to bring the world back from the brink...

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:48.548
...we have to deal with him.

00:00:48.798 --> 00:00:50.258
Should he choose to accept.

00:00:54.971 --> 00:00:58.433
Smart people on every side are close to panicking.

00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:04.689
What exactly is your plan?

00:01:16.868 --> 00:01:18.703
Your team has been betrayed, Ethan.

00:01:20.789 --> 00:01:22.999
All your secrets compromised.

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:27.212
Everything you were...

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:30.507
...everything you've done...

00:01:33.885 --> 00:01:35.053
...has come to this.

00:01:37.889 --> 00:01:40.433
You gave him an aircraft carrier?

00:01:44.813 --> 00:01:48.108
Our lives are the sum of our choices.

00:01:49.526 --> 00:01:50.777
This was your calling.

00:01:52.112 --> 00:01:53.154
Your destiny.

00:01:54.155 --> 00:01:55.615
I have no regrets.

00:01:56.825 --> 00:01:57.909
Neither should you.

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:06.876
I need you to trust me.

00:02:08.378 --> 00:02:09.129
One last time.

